	(text_box "SPEC:\nDRV8323SRTAR  TI  WQFN-40 6x6 (RTA)\nVM 6-60 V rec, 65 V abs max \n3x CSA \nSPI\n1 A/2 A gate drive\nDigital pin abs max 5.75 V (independent of VM)\nSPx/SNx: +/-1 V continuous, +/-3 V transient 200 ns"
